[2026-05-31T15:17:31.111539] [INFO] Node Code Reviewer - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call read_file_segment for node Code Reviewer Details: {'tool_result': {'path': 'geotext_extractor.py', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'newline': '\r\n', 'start_line': 1, 'end_line': 16, 'line_count': 40, 'lines_returned': 16, 'total_lines': 16, 'snippet': '"""\r\nThis module contains the GeotextExtractor class for extracting geographical information from text.\r\n"""\r\n\r\nfrom typing import List\r\nimport re\r\n\r\nclass GeotextExtractor:\r\n    def __init__(self):\r\n        self.location_pattern = r\'\\b[A-Z][a-z]*\\b\'  # Simple regex for location extraction\r\n\r\n    def extract_locations(self, text: str) -> List[str]:\r\n        """\r\n        Extracts location names from the provided text using regex.\r\n        """\r\n        self.location_pattern = r\'\\b[A-Z][a-z]+(?: [A-Z][a-z]+)*\\b\'  # Enhanced regex for location extraction', 'truncated': False, 'file_size': 559, 'modified_ts': 1780233444.3037386, 'mode': 'line_range'}, 'tool_name': 'read_file_segment', 'success': True, 'result_size': 872, 'arguments': {'path': 'geotext_extractor.py', 'start_line': 1, 'line_count': 40}, 'stage': 'after'} Duration: 0.034514427185058594
